title: 私有化
subtitle: [+ chancellor +] 试图逆转我们的社会主义政策
view-if: nationalization_progress > 0 and papenomics_timer < 1 and not spd_in_government and not spd_caretaker and ((not (president == "Braun" or president == "Schumacher" or president == "Juchacz" or president == "Thälmann" or president == "Münzenberg")) or (in_bourgeois_coalition or in_right_coalition))
tags: event
new-page: true
on-arrival: papenomics_timer += 5

= Privatization

在执政期间,我们通过左翼计划推进经济的社会化,以推动我们的议程。最近,[+ chancellor +] 的新资产阶级内阁宣布打算着手逆转这一政策。

- @break_toleration: 我们将投反对票,搞垮这个政府。
- @nothing_to_be_done: 我们无能为力。
- @no_choice: 我们别无选择,只能继续容忍。
- @fight: 以武力保卫被占领的工厂!

@break_toleration
view-if: spd_toleration
subtitle: 这很难办 —— 资产阶级在这一点上团结一致。
go-to: break_toleration_success if left_coalition+sapd_r >= 50; break_toleration_failure if left_coalition+sapd_r < 50

@break_toleration_success
on-arrival: time_to_election = 3; pro_republic -= 4
call: set_next_election_time

我们成功否决了私有化措施,搞垮了政府,迫使 [+ president +] 解散国会以举行新的选举,选举定于 [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +]。

@break_toleration_failure
on-arrival: socialism += 1; nationalization_progress -= 1; capital_strike_progress -= 2; bourgeois_power += 0.05; unemployed += 3.5 if unemployed < 6; unemployed += 1.2 if works_councils < 3; workers -= 2 if nationalization_progress >= 2; budget += 3; works_program -= 1; workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd -= 2; new_middle_spd += 1 if new_middle_conscious; old_middle_spd -= 3; inflation -= 2; economic_growth -= 1.7 if economic_growth >= 5

遗憾的是,包括极右翼在内的资产阶级政党联合起来,通过投票反对我们来恢复资产阶级的经济主导地位。私有化措施获得通过。

@nothing_to_be_done
view-if: not spd_toleration
on-arrival: socialism -= 1; nationalization_progress -= 1; capital_strike_progress -= 2; bourgeois_power += 0.05; unemployed += 3.5 if unemployed < 6; unemployed += 1.2 if works_councils < 3; workers -= 2 if nationalization_progress >= 2; budget += 3; works_program -= 1; workers_spd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd -= 2; new_middle_spd += 1 if new_middle_conscious; old_middle_spd -= 3; inflation -= 2; economic_growth -= 1.7 if economic_growth >= 5

由于对政府毫无影响力,我们无力阻止私有化措施付诸实施。

@no_choice
view-if: spd_toleration
subtitle: 我党将为此震怒。
on-arrival: left_dissent += 10; left_strength -= 5; socialism -= 4; capital_strike_progress -= 2; bourgeois_power += 0.05; unemployed += 3.5 if unemployed < 6; unemployed += 1.2 if works_councils < 3; workers -= 2 if nationalization_progress >= 2; budget += 3; works_program -= 1; workers_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd -= 2; new_middle_spd += 1 if new_middle_conscious; old_middle_spd -= 3; inflation -= 2; economic_growth -= 1.7 if economic_growth >= 5; kpd_relation -= 5

我们现在经不起提前选举的代价,因此别无选择,只能继续容忍。遗憾的是,我党许多人并不这么看;而共产党则从我们看似背弃自身传统中获益。

@fight
view-if: factory_takeovers
choose-if: (rb_militancy*(left_strength/100)) >= 0.1
unavailable-subtitle: 国旗团的战斗性不足。
on-arrival: reformist_dissent += 5

我们确定吗?这至少从资产阶级及其法院的眼中看,将是妨碍司法。光是考虑这个选项就足以激怒我们的改良派。

- @fight_2: 对,战斗。
- @break_toleration: 我们将投反对票,搞垮这个政府。
- @nothing_to_be_done: 我们无能为力。
- @no_choice: 我们别无选择,只能继续容忍。

@fight_2
on-arrival: z_relation -= 20; reichswehr_loyalty = 0; ddp_relation -= 20; dvp_relation -= 20; old_middle_spd -= 5*bourgeois_power; new_middle_spd -= 3*bourgeois_power; rural_spd -= 3*bourgeois_power; old_middle_nsdap += 6; new_middle_nsdap += (5 - new_middle_conscious); rural_nsdap += (8 - land_reform); workers_nsdap += 4*(1-(socialism/100))*bourgeois_power; workers_spd -= workers_nsdap*(1-(socialism/100))*bourgeois_power; scab_power = sh_strength*sh_militancy; scab_power += sa_strength*sa_militancy; scab_power += reichswehr_strength*reichswehr_militancy*0.25; striker_power = rb_strength*rb_militancy*(1-dissent/2); striker_power += workers_spd_normalized*(2 - dissent)*(2 - unemployed/100)
go-to: fight_2_win if striker_power >= scab_power; fight_2_loss if striker_power < scab_power

@fight_2_win
on-arrival: socialism += 2; pro_republic -= 5; capital_strike_progress += 5; strife += 2; sa_militancy += 0.05; coup_progress += 3; time_to_election = 2
call: set_next_election_time

我们部署国旗团及其他工人力量的武装队伍,以武力保卫被占领的工厂,阻止私人重新取得对它们的控制。

[+ chancellor +] 在耻辱中辞职,[+ president +] 宣布新的选举,定于 [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +]。

